 "introduction_text": "<div class=\"ql-editor read-mode\"><p>Please ensure that all passport details are entered exactly as shown in your official passport. Accurate information helps us process your submission smoothly and avoid delays. Kindly double-check your ID number, passport number, and expiry date before submitting.</p><p><br></p><h3>Visa Photo Guidelines</h3><p>To make sure your photo is accepted smoothly, please keep these points in mind. Think of it as presenting yourself in a respectful and professional way:</p><ul><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Use a plain white background so your face is clear and easy to see.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Kindly remove your glasses \u2014 we want your eyes to be visible without any reflection.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Keep a calm, formal expression. A gentle smile is fine, but avoid showing teeth.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>For men: please do not wear hats or head coverings.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>For women: a headscarf (tudung) is welcome and encouraged.</li></ul><p>These steps are not meant to be strict rules, but simple guidance to help your application go through without delays. Thank you for taking the time to prepare your photo carefully \u2014 it really makes the process easier for everyone.</p><p><br></p><h3>Example of Photo Submition</h3><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://biz.rpwp.my/files/JiuXcar.jpg?fid=94c44c458d\"> <img src=\"https://biz.rpwp.my/files/LFZCPwa.png?fid=51caa6e5d6\" width=\"275\"></p></div>",
